WEBVTT

00:36:57.044 --> 00:37:00.698
She spent 17 years
as a speedball heroin junkie

00:37:00.722 --> 00:37:03.515
on the Lower East Side in the 1980s

00:37:03.539 --> 00:37:05.998
and should have died, did die.

00:37:06.022 --> 00:37:09.856
One of the things she used to say when
she was diagnosed with pancreatic cancer

00:37:09.880 --> 00:37:14.111
was, "You know, I've had
some experience with this.

00:37:14.135 --> 00:37:16.100
This will be my fourth time dying."

00:37:16.124 --> 00:37:20.001
She had overdosed on many occasions.

00:37:20.025 --> 00:37:22.553
She had rock-bottomed.

00:37:23.240 --> 00:37:27.308
She rode life very hard,
and it rode her very hard.

00:37:27.332 --> 00:37:30.226
She was in prison a number of times.